  "headline_sentences": [
    "On attack families held out of training entirely (leave-one-family-out, 6 families), the reject option at 0.99 cuts silent misses (attack flows passed as benign) from 70.5% to 7.7% and sends 91.4% to an analyst as unknown, while answering 66.5% of known traffic at 99.4% reliability.",
    "On the held-out split, wrong automatic verdicts fall from 1,683 to 44 per 10,000 flows (1,106 to 29 of 6,570), with 3,524 per 10,000 sent to an analyst."
  ]
